Eh! Don't dis Sunsword!
It's a permanent secondclass lightsource, it grants resistance to some
sorts of blinding and it really takes undead to the cleaners; there
are two guaranteed huge graveyards in the game, and Sunsword really,
ahem, shines there. It's much better than Giantslayer, Trollsbane or
(spit) Ogresmasher.

